  :description "MouseMine is a powerful new system for online access to mouse data from MGI (Mouse Genome Informatics). For more than 20 years, MGI has provided high-quality scientific data on the laboratory mouse, gathered and integrated from hundreds of sources. Over the years, MGI has provided an evolving set of tools for accessing those data, including an interactive web interface (WI), database reports downloaded from our ftp site, direct SQL access, and most recently, via data warehouse systems such as BioMart. MouseMine represents a new generation of access to MGI data. Powered by InterMine, MouseMine offers flexible querying, numerous predefined query templates, a point-and-click interface for building your own queries or modifying a template, iterative refinement of results, built-in enrichment analysis, downloading in multiple formats, forwarding to Galaxy, and more."
